== Std in a chip build's dependency
../logger/src/Logger.zs:1: error: package 'logger' uses File, part of Std, which needs an operating system; a build for cortex-m4 has none, so it can't depend on this package
exit 1
== a dependency's manifest: its main inside it, a size that fits, at most 1 MB
zs: …/evil/zs.toml: [package] main: "/dev/stdin" isn't a path inside the package
zs: …/evil/zs.toml: [target.cortex-m4] heap: expected a size such as "16K", found "9000000000000000M"
zs: …/evil/zs.toml: is 1100000 bytes; a manifest is at most 1 MB
